type: software
title: "Cardiac-Cycle Timing and Wavelet–Fourier Features for Patient-Independent Heart-Murmur Screening"
abstract: "Pre-registered, patient-independent comparison of wavelet-packet, Fourier (STFT) and wavelet-scattering features for heart-murmur detection on the PhysioNet CirCor DigiScope v1.0.3 dataset, with cardiac-cycle timing controls, automatic segmentation, shortcut-learning controls and an external test on ZCHSound. EC418 course project, National Institute of Technology Warangal."
